OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed, as victim's 'sheer
OL,4,Abravery' praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapist has been jailed, as police
OL,7,Fcommended the "sheer bravery" of his
OL,8,Fvictim.
OL,10,FToby Snow, 29, from Scunthorpe, was
OL,11,Ffound guilty of four counts of rape and
OL,12,Fone count of sexual assault following a
OL,13,Ffour-day trial at Hull Crown Court in
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FHe was found not guilty of intentional
OL,17,Fstrangulation.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
