OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed, as victim's 'sheer
OL,4,Abravery' praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FSnow was sentenced at Grimsby Crown
OL,7,FCourt on 16 October to 11 years in
OL,8,Fprison, with an extended licence period
OL,9,Fof four years. He will also be on the
OL,10,Fsex offenders register for the
OL,11,Fremainder of his life.
